# Explicit: test-runner keys (test-keys/test-sitting/test-matrix) must never
# reach git, even if the wildcard patterns above are ever narrowed.
# NEVER commit a real API key. Local dev key lives in untracked .env
# (see .env.example). Production key lives in the Netlify dashboard only.

